  "_id_patterns_note": "harness 通用 ID 文法（非 feature-specific）。linter C3/C4/C6/C7/C8 全讀此處，自身不寫死任何 ID 字串。值為 Python re 語法。",
  "id_patterns": {
    "functional_requirement": "FR-\\d+",
    "use_case": "UC-\\d+",
    "use_case_heading": "^#{1,6}\\s*UC-0*(\\d+)",
    "security_test": "TC-SEC-\\d+",
    "threat_row": "^\\|\\s*TM-\\d+",
    "adr_placeholder": "\\bADR-TBD\\b",
    "adr_resolved_ref": "(→ ?已落地|ADR-TBD ?→|→ ?\\d{4})"
  },
  "_header_standard_note": "KB-12 Universal Header 機械投影。linter C10（pill + Status enum）/ C11（ASCII 框圖殘留）讀此處，自身不寫死 emoji / 框線字元。改格式標準先改 KB-12，再同步此處。",
  "header_standard": {
    "required_pills": ["📋", "🗓", "🔖", "👤"],
    "link_pill_any_of": ["🔗", "🎯"],
    "status_enum": ["draft", "reviewed", "frozen", "superseded", "Proposed", "Accepted", "generated"],
    "ascii_box_chars": "[┌┐└┘▼▲◀▶◄►]",
    "exempt_dirs": ["docs/foundation/"],
    "exempt_files": ["docs/README.md"]
  },
  "_feature_bindings_note": "每個 key = 一個 feature slug，value 為巢狀物件，描述該 feature 的文件座標。通用模板留空 {}（所有 feature-scoped 檢查 C2/C4/C6/C7/C8/C9/C13c 變 no-op skip）。開新 feature 時照此 schema 加一筆，把 <feature> 換成你的 slug：{ \"<feature>\": { \"gates\": { \"Gate1_PRD\": \"docs/prd/<feature>.md\", \"Gate2_UXFlow\": \"docs/ux/user-flow-<feature>.md\", \"Gate3_SystemSpec\": \"docs/analysis/system-spec-<feature>.md\", \"Gate4_NFR_ADR\": \"docs/architecture/nfr-<feature>.md\", \"Gate5a_API\": \"docs/api/openapi-<feature>.yaml\", \"Gate5b_DBSchema\": \"docs/data/erd-<feature>.md\", \"Gate6_TestReady\": \"docs/qa/test-plan-<feature>.md\", \"Gate7_Release\": \"docs/ops/release-readiness-<feature>.md\" }, \"docs\": { \"threat_model\": \"docs/security/threat-model-<feature>.md\", \"traceability_matrix\": \"docs/traceability-matrix-<feature>.md\" }, \"dead_path_patterns\": [\"user-flow-<old-slug>\\\\.md\"] } }。gates 必填（C9/C13c）；docs.threat_model 驅動 C4/C6、docs.traceability_matrix 驅動 C7（缺則該檢查 skip）；dead_path_patterns 選填（C2 偵測改名殘留連結，預設空 = skip）。",
  "feature_bindings": {}
